    /// the same application, including access to objects shared with team members.
    /// Treat it as a bearer credential. Revoke an individual code with
    /// DELETE /api/v1/teams/:team/invite/:code before issuing a replacement.
    /// Revocation does not remove existing members or their access.
    ///
    /// - Parameters:
    ///   - team: Team ID (`tm_...`) identifying the team for which to generate the invite code.
    /// - Returns: The newly created team invite containing the join code.
    public func create(team: String) async throws -> TeamInvite {
        return try await http.request("/api/v1/teams/\(team)/invite", method: "POST")
    }

    /// Revoke a team invite code
    ///
    /// Deletes one invite code for this team. Requires an owner or admin membership.
    /// Future redemption returns 404, as for an unknown or expired code. Existing
    /// memberships and their access are unchanged; remove members separately to end
    /// their access. Redemption already in flight is not cancelled.
